                    All sales of products and services within the server are final, including virtual items and currency. No refunds will be given. If you believe an unauthorized charge was made under your account, you must notify the owner or an higher up operating the webserver immediately.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Permission from the primary account holder for billing must be gained prior to making purchases. If permission has not been granted, an higher up reserves the right to cancel subscription accounts linked to unapproved purchases. If your account or subscription is terminated by either party, no refund will be granted; no online time or other credits will be credited to you; and you will have no further access to your account. 
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="tos-section">
                <h3>2. Property &amp; Use of ROBLOX Brand</h3>
