                    The webserver operates by reusing Roblox assets that came from the official roblox website and public hosted executables with roblox engine used for playing that have been archived prior 2022. "I" dont claim responsibility for anyone who's assets get stolen and reuploaded from official Roblox Servers or elsewhere. If such thing happens to you, please contact a higher up for removal. You must bring evidence of the ownership first though.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="tos-section">
                <h3>3. User Generated Content &amp; Rules of Conduct</h3>
                <p>
                    Most models, games, and content come straight from other users, not from an higher up. Use the Report Abuse link to alert us of any inappropriate content. If anyone asks for your password or personal information (such as your name, address or phone number), please let us know immediately by clicking on the Report Abuse link beside the item or text.  
                </p>
                <p>
                    All user content and communications on the site may be filtered and monitored. we do not pre-screen all submitted content, but any higher up shall have the right in their sole discretion to reject or remove any content that is available via the site. 
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="tos-section">
                <h3>4. Ownership of User Generated Content</h3>
                <p>
                    All uploaded content now belongs to the owner of whoever running is the webserver, excluding stolen, unoriginal content. If you create a game, author a model, or write something that catches our eye on a message board, we might want to use it on the site or elsewhere. By submitting your content and comments, you (or your parents) are agreeing that it's okay for us to use it in an ad, or any way we want, anywhere.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="tos-section">
                <h3>5. Your Data</h3>
                <p>
                    By using the webserver as a user, you agree to your data like when you browse the site, activity, your device type being used to improve the expierience while using the site and for possible global monitoring, analytics.
                </p>
                <p>
                    </p><hr style="margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 40px;">
                <p></p>
                <p>
                    We reserve the right to prohibit the use of the site to any user at any time.
                </p>
                <p>
                    There are additional rules and guidelines for behavior beyond the Terms of Service. They can be found in the rules posted by staff on the Forums or instructed by owner elsewhere.
                </p>
